<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Drishti Nexus incident report for session {{.Session.SessionID}}: incidents, cited evidence lines, ATT&amp;CK techniques, chain of custody and the audit session.">
<title>Drishti Nexus incident report - session {{.Session.SessionID}}</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --space-3xs: 2px; --space-2xs: 4px; --space-xs: 8px; --space-sm: 12px; --space-md: 16px; --space-lg: 24px; --space-xl: 40px; --space-2xl: 64px; --space-3xl: 96px;
  --text-xs: 0.75rem; --text-sm: 0.875rem; --text-md: 1rem; --text-lg: 1.2rem; --text-xl: 1.44rem; --text-2xl: 1.728rem; --text-3xl: 2.488rem;
  --color-paper: oklch(97.2% 0.006 215); --color-paper-2: oklch(94% 0.009 215); --color-paper-hi: oklch(99% 0.004 215);
  --color-ink: oklch(16% 0.032 250); --color-ink-2: oklch(34% 0.022 245); --color-muted: oklch(47% 0.018 240);
  --color-rule: oklch(84% 0.010 225);
  --color-accent: oklch(68% 0.172 50); --color-accent-ink: oklch(16% 0.032 250); --color-focus: oklch(52% 0.15 48);
  --color-ok: oklch(44% 0.11 150);
  --color-dot: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-ink) 20%, transparent); --color-mark: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-ink) 72%, transparent);
  --color-select: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 22%, transparent);
  --font-display: "Iowan Old Style", Charter, "Sitka Text", Cambria, Georgia, ui-serif, serif;
  --font-body: system-ui, "Segoe UI", -apple-system, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: ui-monospace, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;
  --radius: 3px; --rule-hair: 1px;
  --shadow-sheet: 1px 2px 0 color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-ink) 7%, transparent), 10px 18px 36px -14px color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-ink) 32%, transparent);
  --tracking-display: -0.015em;
  --container: 1180px; --gutter: 48px; --time-col: 13rem;
}
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { overflow-x: clip; }
html { scrollbar-color: var(--color-muted) var(--color-paper); }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--color-paper); color: var(--color-ink); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-md); line-height: 1.55; }
::selection { background: var(--color-select); color: var(--color-ink); }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus); outline-offset: 2px; }
a { color: inherit; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 0.16em; }
a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent); }
a:active { color: var(--color-ink-2); }
h1, h2, h3 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-synthesis: none; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); color: var(--color-ink); line-height: 1.1; overflow-wrap: break-word; min-width: 0; text-wrap: balance; }
h1 { font-size: var(--text-3xl); max-width: 22ch; }
h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
h3 { font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: 1.25; }
p { margin: 0; text-wrap: pretty; max-width: 72ch; }
code, .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-sm); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.muted { color: var(--color-muted); }
.n { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

main { max-width: var(--container); margin-inline: auto; padding: 0 var(--gutter) var(--space-3xl); }

/* masthead */
.mast { position: relative; isolation: isolate; padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl); border-bottom: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-ink); }
.mast::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, var(--color-dot) 1px, transparent 1.4px); background-size: 24px 24px;
  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(var(--color-ink) 40%, transparent); mask-image: linear-gradient(var(--color-ink) 40%, transparent); }
.mast-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr); gap: var(--space-xl); align-items: end; }
.mast .lede { margin-top: var(--space-md); color: var(--color-ink-2); max-width: 58ch; }
.meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-md); margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.meta dt { color: var(--color-muted); }
.meta dd { margin: 0; }

/* sections */
.sec { padding-top: var(--space-2xl); }
.sec > h2 { padding-top: var(--space-sm); border-top: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
.sec > p.muted { margin-bottom: var(--space-md); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 18rem), 1fr)); gap: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl); align-items: start; }
.cols-wide { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr); }
.cols h3 { margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }

/* the figures row */
.figures { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(8.5rem, 1fr)); margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl); padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.figures li { padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-md) var(--space-sm); border-left: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-rule); }
.figures li:first-child { border-left: 0; padding-left: 0; }
.figures b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: var(--text-2xl); line-height: 1.15; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums; }
.figures span { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); }

/* tables */
.tw { overflow-x: auto; margin: 0 0 var(--space-md); }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
th, td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm) var(--space-xs) 0; border-bottom: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-rule); }
th:last-child, td:last-child { padding-right: 0; }
thead th { font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink-2); border-bottom-color: var(--color-ink); }
td.mono, td code { font-size: var(--text-xs); line-height: 1.5; }
.kv th { width: 13rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink-2); }

/* severity and checks: one orange, held for what must be seen first */
.sev { display: inline-block; padding: 0 var(--space-xs); border: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink-2); text-transform: capitalize; white-space: nowrap; }
.sev-critical { background: var(--color-accent); border-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent-ink); }
.sev-high { border-color: var(--color-ink); color: var(--color-ink); }
.sev-low { color: var(--color-muted); }
.ok { color: var(--color-ok); font-weight: 600; }
.bad { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent-ink); font-weight: 700; padding: 0 var(--space-2xs); border-radius: var(--radius); }
.warn { color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 600; }
.tag { display: inline-block; margin: 0 var(--space-2xs) var(--space-2xs) 0; padding: 0 var(--space-xs); border: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius); font-size: var(--text-xs); line-height: 1.6; background: var(--color-paper-hi); white-space: nowrap; }

/* incident index */
.idx a { font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }

/* the incident sheet */
.sheet { position: relative; margin: var(--space-xl) 0; padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) var(--space-sm); background: var(--color-paper-hi); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sheet); break-inside: auto; }
.sheet::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: calc(-1 * var(--space-sm)); pointer-events: none;
  --m: var(--color-mark); --l: 8px; --o: 12px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) 0 var(--o) / var(--l) 1px no-repeat, linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) var(--o) 0 / 1px var(--l) no-repeat,
    linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) 100% var(--o) / var(--l) 1px no-repeat, linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) calc(100% - var(--o)) 0 / 1px var(--l) no-repeat,
    linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) 0 calc(100% - var(--o)) / var(--l) 1px no-repeat, linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) var(--o) 100% / 1px var(--l) no-repeat,
    linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) 100% calc(100% - var(--o)) / var(--l) 1px no-repeat, linear-gradient(var(--m), var(--m)) calc(100% - var(--o)) 100% / 1px var(--l) no-repeat; }
.sheet-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: var(--time-col) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-xs) var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-md); border-bottom: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-ink); }
.sheet-head h3 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
.sheet-head .sev { margin-top: var(--space-xs); }
.window { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-ink-2); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.window span { display: block; }
.keys { margin-top: var(--space-2xs); font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--color-muted); }

.timeline { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.timeline > li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: var(--time-col) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-lg); padding: var(--space-lg) 0 var(--space-sm); border-bottom: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-rule); }
.timeline > li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.when { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.when .sev { margin-top: var(--space-2xs); }
.alert-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-sm); }
.alert-head h4 { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 650; }
.alert-head .muted { font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.alert-body > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-xs); }
.attack { font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.attack .tactic { color: var(--color-muted); margin-left: var(--space-2xs); }
.details { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-md); font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); }
.details code { color: var(--color-ink); font-size: var(--text-xs); }
.related { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); }
.timeline .tw { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; }
.timeline td:nth-child(2):not([colspan]) { white-space: nowrap; }

/* custody hashes */
.hash { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3.5rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0 var(--space-xs); }
.hash span { color: var(--color-muted); font-family: var(--font-body); }

/* AI, kept apart from evidence */
.ai { margin-top: var(--space-md); padding: var(--space-lg); border: var(--rule-hair) dashed var(--color-accent); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--color-paper-2); }
.ai > p:first-child { margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
.ai-item { padding-top: var(--space-md); margin-top: var(--space-md); border-top: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-rule); }
.ai-item .model { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); margin: var(--space-2xs) 0 var(--space-xs); }
.ai-item ul { margin: var(--space-2xs) 0 0; }

.foot { margin-top: var(--space-md); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
.warnings { margin: var(--space-xs) 0 0; padding-left: var(--space-lg); }

@media screen and (max-width: 52rem) {
  :root { --gutter: 20px; }
  .mast-body, .cols-wide, .sheet-head, .timeline > li { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .timeline > li { gap: var(--space-xs); }
  .when { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); align-items: baseline; }
  .sheet { padding-inline: var(--space-md); }
  .figures li:nth-child(odd) { border-left: 0; padding-left: 0; }
  .tw table:has(thead) { min-width: 36rem; }
}
@media print {
  :root { --gutter: 0; }
  body { font-size: 10pt; background: none; }
  main { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
  .mast { padding-top: 0; border-bottom: 0; }
  .mast::before { display: none; }
  .sec { padding-top: var(--space-lg); }
  .sheet { box-shadow: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-lg) 0; background: none; }
  .sheet::before { display: none; }
  .timeline > li, .sheet-head { display: block; }
  .timeline > li > * + *, .sheet-head > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-xs); }
  .figures { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .tw { overflow: visible; }
  h2, h3, .sheet-head { break-after: avoid-page; }
  tr, .timeline > li > .when, .figures { break-inside: avoid-page; }
  a { text-decoration: none; }
  .sev, .bad, .ai, .tag { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  @page { size: A4; margin: 14mm 12mm; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header class="mast">
<div class="mast-body">
<div>
<h1>Drishti Nexus incident report</h1>
<p class="lede">All findings below are produced by deterministic, explainable detection rules. Every alert cites the evidence lines it is based on (<code>&lt;file&gt;:&lt;line&gt;</code>).</p>
</div>
<dl class="meta">
<dt>Session</dt><dd><code>{{.Session.SessionID}}</code></dd>
<dt>Generated</dt><dd>{{time .GeneratedAt}}</dd>
<dt>Tool</dt><dd>{{.Session.ToolVersion}}</dd>
</dl>
</div>
</header>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="s-summary">
<h2 id="s-summary">1. Summary</h2>
<ul class="figures">
<li><b>{{.Stats.Incidents}}</b><span>incidents</span></li>
<li><b>{{.Stats.Alerts}}</b><span>alerts</span></li>
<li><b>{{.Stats.Entries}}</b><span>log entries</span></li>
<li><b>{{.Stats.Lines}}</b><span>physical lines</span></li>
<li><b>{{len .Session.Evidence}}</b><span>evidence files</span></li>
<li><b>{{.Stats.DurationMs}} ms</b><span>analysis time</span></li>
</ul>
{{if or .Rules .Techniques}}<div class="cols cols-wide">
{{if .Rules}}<div>
<h3>Alerts by rule</h3>
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th class="n">Alerts</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Rules}}<tr><td>{{.Name}}</td><td class="n">{{.N}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
</div>{{end}}
{{if .Techniques}}<div>
<h3>MITRE ATT&amp;CK techniques observed</h3>
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Technique</th><th>Name</th><th>Tactic</th><th class="n">Alerts</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Techniques}}<tr><td><code>{{.ID}}</code></td><td>{{.Name}}</td><td>{{.Tactic}}</td><td class="n">{{.Alerts}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
</div>{{end}}
</div>{{end}}
{{if .Techniques}}<h3>Compliance references</h3>
<p class="muted">Controls these alerts are evidence for, for auditors. A reference, not a compliance assessment. Every scan also supports {{range $i, $c := monitoring}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$c.Framework}} {{$c.ID}}{{end}}. Rationale: docs/COMPLIANCE_MAPPING.md.</p>
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Technique</th><th>Framework</th><th>Control</th><th>Title</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range $t := .Techniques}}{{range .Controls}}<tr><td><code>{{$t.ID}}</code></td><td>{{.Framework}}</td><td class="mono">{{.ID}}</td><td>{{.Title}}</td></tr>
{{end}}{{end}}</tbody></table></div>{{end}}
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="s-quality">
<h2 id="s-quality">2. Parse quality</h2>
<p class="muted">Clean: a format parser matched exactly. Partial: a parser matched but something was repaired or assumed. BestEffort: no parser matched; raw text kept.</p>
<div class="cols">
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th class="n">Entries</th><th class="n">%</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Quality}}<tr><td>{{.Name}}</td><td class="n">{{.N}}</td><td class="n">{{printf "%.1f" .Pct}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Parser</th><th class="n">Entries</th><th class="n">%</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Parsers}}<tr><td>{{.Name}}</td><td class="n">{{.N}}</td><td class="n">{{printf "%.1f" .Pct}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
{{if .Repairs}}<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Repair / assumption</th><th class="n">Entries</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Repairs}}<tr><td>{{.Name}}</td><td class="n">{{.N}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>{{end}}
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="s-incidents">
<h2 id="s-incidents">3. Incidents</h2>
{{if not .Incidents}}<p>No alerts were raised.</p>{{else}}
<div class="tw idx"><table><thead><tr><th>Incident</th><th>Severity</th><th>First seen</th><th>Last seen</th><th class="n">Alerts</th><th>ATT&amp;CK</th><th>Correlation</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Incidents}}<tr><td><a href="#{{.ID}}">{{.ID}}</a></td><td><span class="sev sev-{{lower .Severity}}">{{.Severity}}</span></td><td>{{time .Start}}</td><td>{{time .End}}</td><td class="n">{{len .Alerts}}</td><td>{{join .Techniques ", "}}</td><td class="mono">{{join .Keys "; "}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>

{{range .Incidents}}
<article class="sheet" id="{{.ID}}" aria-labelledby="h-{{.ID}}">
<header class="sheet-head">
<div><h3 id="h-{{.ID}}">{{.ID}}</h3><span class="sev sev-{{lower .Severity}}">{{.Severity}}</span></div>
<div>
<p class="window"><span>From {{time .Start}}</span><span>to {{time .End}}</span></p>
<p>{{range .Techniques}}<span class="tag">{{.}}</span>{{end}}</p>
<p class="keys mono">{{join .Keys "; "}}</p>
</div>
</header>
<ol class="timeline">
{{range .Alerts}}<li>
<div class="when"><time>{{time .Timestamp}}</time> <span class="sev sev-{{lower .Severity}}">{{.Severity}}</span></div>
<div class="alert-body">
<div class="alert-head"><h4>{{.RuleName}}</h4><code class="muted">{{.ID}}</code>{{if gt .Count 1}}<span class="muted">{{.Count}} matches until {{time .LastSeen}}</span>{{end}}</div>
<p>{{.Description}}</p>
{{if .MITRETechniqueID}}<p class="attack"><span class="tag">ATT&amp;CK {{.MITRETechniqueID}}{{if .MITRETechniqueName}} {{.MITRETechniqueName}}{{end}}</span>{{if .MITRETactic}}<span class="tactic">{{.MITRETactic}}</span>{{end}}</p>{{end}}
{{if .Details}}<p class="details">{{range .Details}}<span>{{.Key}}=<code>{{.Value}}</code></span>{{end}}</p>{{end}}
{{if .RelatedAlerts}}<p class="related">Related alerts: {{join .RelatedAlerts ", "}}</p>{{end}}
</div>
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Evidence line</th><th>Time</th><th>Source</th><th>Parsed message</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Evidence}}<tr><td class="mono">{{.ID}}</td>{{if .Found}}<td>{{time .Time}}</td><td>{{.Source}}</td><td class="mono">{{.Text}}</td>{{else}}<td colspan="3" class="muted">entry not retained in this run (alerts-only or store cap); the line is in the evidence file at this ID</td>{{end}}</tr>
{{end}}{{if .Omitted}}<tr><td colspan="4" class="muted">+{{.Omitted}} more cited lines, listed in the JSON report</td></tr>{{end}}
</tbody></table></div>
</li>
{{end}}</ol>
</article>
{{end}}{{end}}
</section>

{{if .AISummaries}}
<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="s-ai">
<h2 id="s-ai">AI-generated summaries (not evidence)</h2>
<div class="ai">
<p><b>These narratives were generated by a language model from the deterministic findings above. They are not evidence and are not part of the detection results.</b> Verify every statement against the cited alerts and evidence lines.</p>
{{range .AISummaries}}
<div class="ai-item">
<h3>{{.IncidentID}}</h3>
<p class="model">Model {{.Model}}<br>{{if .Verified}}<span class="ok">all claims matched the incident data</span>{{else}}<span class="bad">NOT verified against the incident data</span>{{end}}</p>
<p>{{.Text}}</p>
{{if .Unsupported}}<p class="warn">Unsupported claims:</p><ul>{{range .Unsupported}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{end}}</ul>{{end}}
</div>
{{end}}
</div>
</section>
{{end}}

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="s-custody">
<h2 id="s-custody">4. Chain of custody</h2>
<p class="muted">Evidence was opened read-only. Each file is hashed before analysis and re-hashed afterwards; a mismatch means it changed during analysis.</p>
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Evidence file</th><th class="n">Bytes</th><th>SHA-256 before / after</th><th>Check</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Session.Evidence}}<tr><td class="mono">{{.Path}}</td><td class="n">{{.SizeBytes}}</td><td class="mono hash"><span>before</span>{{.SHA256Before}}<span>after</span>{{if .SHA256After}}{{.SHA256After}}{{else}}-{{end}}</td><td>{{$u := unchanged .}}{{if eq $u "unchanged"}}<span class="ok">{{$u}}</span>{{else}}<span class="bad">{{$u}}</span>{{end}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
<div class="tw"><table class="kv"><tbody>
<tr><th>Detection config</th><td class="mono">{{if .Session.Config.ConfigPath}}{{.Session.Config.ConfigPath}}<br>sha256 {{.Session.Config.ConfigSHA256}}{{else}}built-in defaults{{end}}</td></tr>
{{range .Session.Config.Definitions}}<tr><th>Definition file</th><td class="mono">{{.Path}}<br>sha256 {{.SHA256}}</td></tr>
{{end}}{{range .Session.Outputs}}<tr><th>Output</th><td class="mono">{{.Path}}<br>sha256 {{.SHA256}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
<p class="muted foot">This report file is itself hashed in the session_end record of the audit log.</p>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="s-audit">
<h2 id="s-audit">5. Audit session</h2>
<div class="tw"><table class="kv"><tbody>
<tr><th>Session ID</th><td class="mono">{{.Session.SessionID}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Command</th><td class="mono">{{.Session.Command}} {{join .Session.Args " "}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Analyst (OS user)</th><td>{{.Session.OSUser}} on {{.Session.Hostname}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Tool</th><td>Drishti Nexus {{.Session.ToolVersion}} ({{.Session.GoVersion}}, {{.Session.Platform}})</td></tr>
<tr><th>Started</th><td>{{time .Session.StartedAt}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Report generated</th><td>{{time .GeneratedAt}} (the session_end record follows in the audit log)</td></tr>
{{if .Session.RecordHash}}<tr><th>session_start record hash</th><td class="mono">{{.Session.RecordHash}}</td></tr>{{end}}
<tr><th>Normal hours</th><td>{{.Session.Config.NormalHours}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Incident gap</th><td>{{.Session.Config.IncidentGap}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Adaptive thresholds</th><td>{{if .Session.Config.Adaptive}}{{.Session.Config.Adaptive}}{{else}}-{{end}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Assumed timezone</th><td>{{.Session.Config.AssumedTimezone}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Storage</th><td>{{.Session.Config.Storage}}</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<div class="tw"><table><thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Enabled</th><th>Severity</th><th class="n">Threshold</th><th>Window</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Session.Config.Rules}}<tr><td>{{.Name}}</td><td>{{.Enabled}}</td><td>{{.Severity}}</td><td class="n">{{if .Threshold}}{{.Threshold}}{{else}}-{{end}}</td><td>{{if .Window}}{{.Window}}{{else}}-{{end}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
{{if .Session.Config.Warnings}}<h3>Warnings</h3><ul class="warnings">{{range .Session.Config.Warnings}}<li class="warn">{{.}}</li>{{end}}</ul>{{end}}
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
